<title>GERMANY: BfG sees marked rise in 1997 net profit.</title>
<headline>BfG sees marked rise in 1997 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's BfG Bank said on Wednesday that it expected a notable rise in its net profit in 1997.</p>
<p>For 1996, the bank reported a net profit of 158 million marks.</p>
<p>It said today that first half 1997 operating profit after risk provisions jumped 69.7 percent to 159 million marks.</p>
</text>
